{"parentUuid":"49797a95-9304-4c7e-800f-8048c622c899","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"REDACTED.js","snippet":"1\tconst G = window.hedgerow.G;\n2\t// right after load: fire the first flare ourselves and watch the frame times through its pop\n3\tawait stand(0.5, 104, 0.0, -0.1, 400);\n4\tconst progs0 = (G.renderer.info.programs || []).length;\n5\tG.flares.launchNow(G.camera.position);\n6\tconst times = [];\n7\tlet last = performance.now();\n8\tfor (let i = 0; i < 450; i++) { await new Promise(res => requestAnimationFrame(res)); const now = performance.now(); times.push(now - last); last = now; }\n9\tconst progs1 = (G.renderer.info.programs || []).length;\n10\tconst sorted = [...times].sort((a, b) => a - b);\n11\treturn { worst: Math.round(sorted[sorted.length - 1]), p95: Math.round(sorted[Math.floor(sorted.length * 0.95)]), median: Math.round(sorted[sorted.length >> 1]), newPrograms: progs1 - progs0, popped: G.flares.shadowing };"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"f98e96d4-2a72-47b0-bfc6-98b0a216bf97","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:05:26.841Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: REDACTED.js changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. Here are the relevant changes (shown with line numbers):\n1\tconst G = window.hedgerow.G;\n2\t// right after load: fire the first flare ourselves and watch the frame times through its pop\n3\tawait stand(0.5, 104, 0.0, -0.1, 400);\n4\tconst progs0 = (G.renderer.info.programs || []).length;\n5\tG.flares.launchNow(G.camera.position);\n6\tconst times = [];\n7\tlet last = performance.now();\n8\tfor (let i = 0; i < 450; i++) { await new Promise(res => requestAnimationFrame(res)); const now = performance.now(); times.push(now - last); last = now; }\n9\tconst progs1 = (G.renderer.info.programs || []).length;\n10\tconst sort