{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","id":"320a5917-9c20-4e4e-a40f-0779b0e9da7f","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:08:00.337Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"e4c25ecdb75ce09b041f36a232e6214310633727d536ee9fd0fbafcb9d3ffc0c","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"3b20e31a-fa4e-48f4-8eb4-729000a60d87","keep":1062,"tail":["0e55157efa4ad0f7855625eb4db521097264384eaf4a5b31c2ea04210d1093f4","d9ec7d7bb63dc0121951337986d6d5ce2b703b39a1784b842cffb4b26368bdac","7b78c7223b5f6de4c34efbbbb851ac425bd49de9882a137f3dd553e0e2d592cd"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1064,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"653c66ed3e512df9f1f87c2d3c121e0a3b4f72691cca80451f19dab307a54a00"}
{"parentUuid":"7d3fe754-7173-4a95-8cf3-6e90433dcecf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFWj5hxe4cqyZ1ribkmU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I committed four more graphics improvements on `hedgerow-grass`; nothing is pushed. The first three are already in `hedgerow-poc` (your session merged them in a5c4deff). The flares (0f66dad5) are not yet; a trial merge onto `hedgerow-poc`'s tip (d65f16e9) has no conflicts. All six tests pass, and the timings are at 1024×768 on the M1 Max.\n\n- **Ground relief near the eye (ae170071):** within about 16 m the ground has real depth. Cobbles stand proud of their joints, the mud keeps its ruts, and leaf litter lies in layers; puddles stay flat with stones breaking through. It costs 0.4–0.7 ms and is on for high and medium.\n- **Stones and twigs at your feet (82ab901b):** stones lie in the mud of the lanes and yards, and twigs on the forest floor, within about 9 m (0.2–0.3 ms). Along the way:\n  - The lane's ground mesh sits up to 9 cm off the height data the placement used, which buried small pieces. Pieces now sit exactly on the mesh.\n  - The grass now skips tufts that are out of view before doing the expensive part, so it costs about 1.4 ms instead of 2.6.\n- **Close-up bark (94022128):** up close, trunks show furrowed bark per species, with moss low on the weather side. A beech used to be a smooth grey column. No measurable cost.\n- **Illumination flares (0f66dad5):** every half minute or so a flare goes up 110–250 m ahead and sinks under its parachute for about 25 seconds.\n  - It lights the cloud deck and glitters on the wet cobbles against the warm lamps.\n  - Houses, walls, soldiers and tree trunks cast long shadows that swing as it drifts. Those shadows cost about 0.8 ms a frame, only while one burns.\n  - The first burst used to stutter for 93 ms while shaders compiled. They now compile at mission start, and the worst frame is 14 ms.\n\nI also tried raindrops beaded on the rifle and sleeves, but they weren't readable at this resolution and lighting, so I dropped them.\n\nFor testing I switched to a headless Chrome that renders on the real GPU, so nothing appeared in your browser pane. Starting it needed the sandbox turned off for that command. It, my server and the browser tab are all closed, and I removed `launch.json`. It only held my entries, and the file hadn't existed before this round.\n\nTwo things for the `main.js` you're editing:\n- `castShadows()` now also handles the flares: tree trunks cast only while a flare burns, and the lamp's shadow holds still meanwhile.\n- `startMission()` warms up the flare shadow shaders."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":719,"cache_read_input_tokens":700940,"output_tokens":919,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":719,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":919,"cache_read_input_tokens":700940,"cache_creation_input_tokens":719,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":719},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9156cf89-1637-45e1-94d4-f850482a5a08","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFWj4pPbBi3Kw9Rs66tQ","requestRef":"320a5917-9c20-4e4e-a40f-0779b0e9da7f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"844988cd-b1d8-433c-a142-5e1692a98fb9","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:08:10.565Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/pr