{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"3433b84254478a319e913d7d2416e2c1bd10045e304228554c459e4c15aa1f29","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The jitter can wrap the single render call without touching camera.js, but since TAA's heavy history blending would wash out thin fast-moving elements like rain, sparks, and tracers, I'll check how the rain currently renders before drawing those after TAA.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SqHjZy6kmXUzEwejSGfsf4","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && sed -n 1,140p js/weather.js","description":"Read the rain and splash shaders"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
