{"parentUuid":"a1f5f28e-50e6-4c22-bc34-a4c23ea96397","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01Guqg9FxMWxCp3jEDKySEVm","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"89e3d783-3808-44d2-bf8f-420f781b6b01","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:31:27.724Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"89e3d783-3808-44d2-bf8f-420f781b6b01","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFYW9aWWxFLWethCY3Ar","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016ezJ6hzBbW9eSjjwbwgPa9","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","content":"# hedgerow-grass session (graphics rounds)\n\nBranch `hedgerow-grass`, worktree `.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass`.\n\nMerged into hedgerow-poc already (a5c4deff):\n- meadow grass (grass.js), ground relief near the eye (terrain.js parallax)\n- stones and twigs (clutter.js + groundmap.js), grass culled to the view\n- close-up bark and moss on tree trunks (materials.js)\n\nOn hedgerow-grass, not yet in hedgerow-poc (all three merge cleanly onto d65f16e9):\n- 0f66dad5 illumination flares over the front: flares.js (new); small hooks in lights.js\n  (far / noLight lights), volumetric.js (per-light fog factor), sky.js (flare glow),\n  effects.js (launch streak), audio.js (pop), main.js (wiring, castShadows extended for\n  flare shadows, shader warm-up at mission start).\n- 09e7b09c flare light in shafts (shafts.js, new; volumetric.js lays it on) and tree crowns\n  casting under the flare (flares.js castersOf: leaf cards with an alpha-cut depth material).\n- 2c09b946 temporal anti-aliasing (taa.js, new): main.js jitters the projection around\n  renderer.render (taa.jitter()/restore()); the chain is now\n  [particles, ssao, ssr, shafts, volumetric, taa, late (additive particles + rain), dof, bloom, grade].\n  effects.js gets a late pass (useLate), weather.js can draw the rain in it (drawLate).\n  Note for camera/first-person work: anything rendered nearer than 1.2 m is treated as moving\n  with the camera (not reprojected); a camera jump over 2 m resets the history.\n\nTried and dropped: raindrops beaded on rifles/outfits (unreadable at this resolution and lighting).\n\nTesting tip: a headless Chrome (playwright's chromium_headless_shell) renders on the real GPU\nwithout the browser pane; driven over CDP from a scratch script (needs the sandbox off to start).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":627,"cache_read_input_tokens":823859,"output_tokens":1157,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":627,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1157,"cache_read_input_tokens":823859,"cache_creation_input_tokens":627,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":627},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_016ezJ6hzBbW9eSjjwbwgPa9":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","content":"# hedgerow-grass session (graphics rounds)\n\nBranch `hedgerow-grass`, worktree `.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass`.\n\nMerged into hedgerow-poc already (a5c4deff):\n- meadow grass (grass.js), ground relief near the eye (terrain.js parallax)\n- stones and twigs (clutter.js + groundmap.js), grass culled to the view\n- close-up bark and moss on tree trunks (materials.js)\n\nOn hedgerow-grass, not yet in hedgerow-poc (all three merge cleanly onto d65f16e9):\n- 0f66dad5 illumination flares over the front: flares.js (new); small hooks in lights.js\n  (far / noLight lights), volumetric.js (per-light fog factor), sky.js (flare glow),\n  effects.js (launch streak), audio.js (pop), main.js (wiring, castShadows extended for\n  flare shadows, shader warm-up at mission start).\n- 09e7b09c flare light in shafts (shafts.js, new; volumetric.js lays it on) and tree crowns\n  casting under the flare (flares.js castersOf: leaf cards with an alpha