d, each found along the view ray\n    against the depth (walls in front are not bent, nor is the rifle) ·\n    `dof.js`"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"374e0ff1-c9cf-45f7-919c-1adb105a5e47","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFZTm6iAfZp1qV1mRsDj","requestRef":"62546280-0017-473c-b664-2ba2305e9651","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"385fa686-3079-448c-aca0-82417e174d5c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:43:57.477Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"385fa686-3079-448c-aca0-82417e174d5c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFZTmz3FPg6SCFpyi3uo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DLYi9xXjMSQeofNGPEfF7r","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/distort.js fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: heat haze over fires, shockwaves from blasts\n\nA distortion pass after the temporal anti-aliasing (distort.js; a\nshimmer that changes every frame would only smear in its history) bends\nthe finished image where hot air or a pressure wave lies between the eye\nand what a pixel shows:\n\n- over each of the four nearest fires within 35 m (the burning truck in\n  the street), a column of hot air four times the fire's size high,\n  thinning upwards, shimmers with noise rising through it;\n- a grenade or charge sends out a shell for half a second (effects.js\n  records it), seen edge-on as a ring that pushes the picture outwards as\n  it races past (a blast behind the camera shows none).\n\nEach is found along the pixel's view ray against the scene depth, so a\nwall in front of a fire is not bent, and the rifle and hands (nearer\nthan 1.2 m) are neither bent nor pulled into a neighbour's shimmer. Off\nwhen there is nothing near; too cheap to measure at 1024x768 on an M1 Max.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -3 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Commit the heat haze and shockwaves, check the merge"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation