{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"a7739a9ef4324f386dd67fdc5b56ba431fe3633fedddee1c3ebc107bc75e5ccc","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UN2jhx8AchbsnH6S53sK2C","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 - <<'PYEOF'\np = 'README.md'\ns = open(p).read()\nold = \"swing as it drifts, its light hanging in the rain in shafts between the roofs.\"\nnew = (\"swing as it drifts, its light hanging in the rain in shafts between the roofs.\\n\"\n       \"Lightning does the same for its fraction of a second: a cold, blinding light\\n\"\n       \"from the bolt, low over the horizon, that throws every house's shadow across\\n\"\n       \"the street.\")\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nold = \"    the start of the mission),\"\nnew = \"    the start of the mission; when none burns, a lightning stroke drives the\\n    same light from the bolt's direction),\"\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nPYEOF\ncd ../.. && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/flares.js fun/hedgerow/js/lights.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: lightning throws hard shadows\n\nA lightning stroke used to lift the ambient and the fixed key light, so\nthe village went flat and grey for a moment. Now, when no flare burns, the\nstroke drives the flare's shadowed directional light (flares.js\nlightning()): cold blue-white from the bolt's own direction, low over the\nhorizon (14-31 degrees), at eleven times the flash, with its 80 m shadow\nmap drawn every other frame of the stroke. For each pulse the houses,\nwalls, soldiers and trees throw long hard shadows (a building's shadow\ncuts straight across the street), and the light stands in the rain in\nshafts, as under a flare; the ambient lift is cut to 0.8 of the flash and\nthe key light's to 0.6 so the shadows read. A burning flare keeps the\nlight. Costs the shadow pass during strokes only (under a second each).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -2 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Update the README and commit the lightning shadows"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
