` (the\n    fires as flame: three billboards per near fire, each a turbulent body\n    of flame worked out in its shader, licking up in tongues, coloured by\n    its heat from deep red to a yellow-white core), `atmosphere.js`\n    (halos, mist, decals),"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"a7cdcef7-168c-4c34-86ac-f6f34a2f9a7d","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFa8UQx2ppMoVVzmYjni","requestRef":"911df5d6-2d3c-4f56-81ea-aea95ad23311","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"4c67a89e-ee25-4c6a-a010-328481f134b5","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:52:42.520Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"4c67a89e-ee25-4c6a-a010-328481f134b5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFa8VK2Jx1AqNYiNBvx8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MdisK5DLsBi9Fd7SPAx6V5","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/flames.js fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: fires burn as flame\n\nThe fires (the burning truck in the street, the house, the flak gun once\nblown) were sprays of flame sprites from a point: a few orange blobs in\nthe truck's cab windows. Now each fire within 60 m carries three upright\nbillboards turned to the camera (flames.js), each a body of flame worked\nout in its shader: noise rising through a shape wide at a ragged base and\nlicking up to points, broken into tongues and eaten away from the top,\ncoloured by its heat like a black body - deep red at the edges, mostly\norange, yellow, white only at the hottest - bright enough to bloom. It is\ndrawn with the late particles after the anti-aliasing (the flicker stays\ncrisp), hidden behind what stands in front and soft where it meets the\ncab or the wall; without the effects chain it is drawn with the scene.\nThe sprite flames thin to a third, licks over the body; the smoke and\nembers stay. Too cheap to measure at 1024x768 on an M1 Max.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -2 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Commit the shader flames and check the merge"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":372,"cache_read_input_tokens":848432,"output_tokens":947,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":372,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":947,"cache_read_input_tokens":848432,"cache_creation_input_tokens":372,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":372},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01MdisK5DLsBi9Fd7SPAx6V5":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/flames.js fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: fires burn as flame\n\nThe fires (the burning truck in the street, the house, the flak gun once\nblown) were sprays of flame sprites from a point: a few orange blobs in\nthe truck's cab windows. Now each fire within 60 m carries three upright\nbillboards turned to the camera (flames.js), each a body of flame worked\nout in its shader: noise rising through a shape wide at a ragged base and\nlicking up to points, broken into tongues and eaten away from the top,\ncoloured by its heat like a black body - deep red at the edges, mostly\norange, yellow, white only at the hottest - bright enough to bloom. It is\ndrawn with the late particles after the anti-aliasing (the flicker stays\ncrisp), hidden behind what stands in front and soft where it meets the\ncab or the wall; without the effects chain it is drawn with the scene.\nThe sprite flames thin to a third, licks over the body; the smoke and\nembers stay. Too cheap to measure at 1024x768 on an M1 Max.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -2 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Commit the shader flames and check the merge"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"a7cdcef7-168c-4c34-86ac-f6f34a2f9a7d","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFa8UQx2ppMoVVzmYjni","requestRef":"911df5d6-2d3c-4f56-81ea-aea95ad23311","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"66fd2bec-3bef-43c5-b87c-8903333b88c3","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:52:47.271Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
