er laps\nthem and the water browner in the shallows of the ford, a forest floor"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"bf73e902-2534-4772-a9ec-c34502c99503","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFaMGg7qD8nWTL1Z9Dmp","requestRef":"7b391b5b-68d1-4a90-9390-073a13d5e03d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5bd91c04-f51d-440e-b5b4-5cbd106112fc","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:55:35.986Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"5bd91c04-f51d-440e-b5b4-5cbd106112fc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFaMHKpTpMH2Y7EPRzct","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013573tWgBRD57Xid5PgE6wp","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/materials.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: the river laps its banks; shallows at the ford\n\nThe river was one dark glossy sheet that met its banks in a hard line.\nIts shader now knows its own depth (the ground map's mesh-exact height,\nread through the grass map the terrain already shares): where it laps\nthe bank a thin, broken line of scum drifts with the current, its reach\nbreathing a little, matte and reflecting nothing (the reflections pass\nskips it); in the shallows (under 0.75 m: the ford, the edges) it turns\nbrowner, the bed showing through. Streaks of foam down the middle were\ntried and dropped: thresholded value noise read as rows of white dashes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -2 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Commit the river shore and shallows"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":283,"cache_read_input_tokens":870968,"output_tokens":759,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":283,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":759,"cache_read_input_tokens":870968,"cache_creation_input_tokens":283,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":283},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_013573tWgBRD57Xid5PgE6wp":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/materials.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: the river laps its banks; shallows at the ford\n\nThe river was one dark glossy sheet that met its banks in a hard line.\nIts shader now knows its own depth (the ground map's mesh-exact height,\nread through the grass map the terrain already shares): where it laps\nthe bank a thin, broken line of scum drifts with the current, its reach\nbreathing a little, matte and reflecting nothing (the reflections pass\nskips it); in the shallows (under 0.75 m: the ford, the edges) it turns\nbrowner, the bed showing through. Streaks of foam down the middle were\ntried and dropped: thresholded value noise read as rows of white dashes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -2 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Commit the river shore and shallows"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"bf73e902-2534-4772-a9ec-c34502c99503","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFaMGg7qD8nWTL1Z9Dmp","requestRef":"7b391b5b-68d1-4a90-9390-073a13d5e03d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"9694dfa2-110d-4ac0-8158-f21386bd2ef0","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:55:39.684Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907