{"parentUuid":"5d59a5a8-4ae3-43ae-98ed-06954fd7726b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFb33WULYQ9A1auvX7zZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Aiming now works correctly—the depth-of-field effect properly sharpens the aimed target while blurring the background and near sight. I'll commit the depth fix separately from the motion blur changes since it's a distinct correction to the TAA pass.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3253,"cache_read_input_tokens":928736,"output_tokens":2107,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":807},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3253,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2107,"cache_read_input_tokens":928736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3253,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3253},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"8d3f8caa-870b-4bf3-8fa7-a2cdb9a885d9","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFb31szL2DfS88Hx9Byc","requestRef":"44a374e9-21af-4bb9-a6a2-ab43c9d96f6a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a745e879-3a22-4df0-9244-c5dae2cde80e","timestamp":"2026-10-21T15:04:43.451Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"a745e879-3a22-4df0-9244-c5dae2cde80e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFb33WULYQ9A1auvX7zZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019M92k1dpWiBTPCsiiZQMW3","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cp js/main.js \"$TMPDIR/main.full.js\" && git show HEAD:fun/hedgerow/js/main.js > js/main.js && python3 - <<'PYEOF'\np = 'js/main.js'\ns = open(p).read()\nold = \"\"\"    renderer.setEffects([...(quality.volumetric ? [G.effects.pass] : []), ...(ao ? [ssao] : []), ...(refl ? [ssr] : []), ...(shaft ? [shafts] : []), ...(quality.volumetric ? [volumetric, taa, G.effects.late, distort, dof] : []), ...(quality.bloom ? [bloom] : []), grade]);\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"    // the passes after the first one that swaps render into the scene's own buffer, whose depth\n    // the later ones still read (taa, the late particles, the haze, the focus): nothing in the\n    // chain may clear it, so depth clears are off from its start to its end\n    renderer.setEffects([KEEP_DEPTH, ...(quality.volumetric ? [G.effects.pass] : []), ...(ao ? [ssao] : []), ...(refl ? [ssr] : []), ...(shaft ? [shafts] : []), ...(quality.volumetric ? [volumetric, taa, G.effects.late, distort, dof] : []), ...(quality.bloom ? [bloom] : []), grade, CLEAR_DEPTH]);\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nold = \"\"\"function applyGraphics() {\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"// around the effects chain: no depth clears inside it (see applyGraphics), back on for the next frame's scene\nconst KEEP_DEPTH = { enabled: true, needsSwap: false, render(r) { r.autoClearDepth = false; } };\nconst CLEAR_DEPTH = { enabled: true, needsSwap: false, render(r) { r.autoClearDepth = true; } };\n\nfunction applyGraphics() {\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nPYEOF\nnode --check js/main.js && cd ../.. && git diff --stat && git add fun/hedgerow/js/main.js && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: keep the scene depth through the effects chain (fix)\n\nSince the temporal anti-aliasing went in, the second pass in the chain\nthat swaps buffers is TAA, which writes into the scene's own render target\n- and three clears a target's depth before drawing into it. Every pass\nafter it read a cleared depth: the late particles, flames and rain were\nno longer hidden behind walls (the burning truck's flames showed through\nits cab), the heat haze was not masked, and the focus when aiming found\nnothing to focus on (no depth of field at all). Depth clears are now off\nfrom the start of the chain to its end (two tiny passes around it), so the\nscene depth survives for every pass; all of them draw full-screen, so none\nneeds a clear. Verified by reading the depth back after TAA (the rifle at\n0.83 m, the hands at 0.3-0.5 m, not the far plane) and by aiming: the\ntarget is sharp, the street beyond and the rear sight soft again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && cp \"$TMPDIR/main.full.js\" fun/hedgerow/js/main.js && git status --short","description":"Commit the depth fix alone, then restore the blur work"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3253,"cache_read_input_tokens":928736,"output_tokens":2107,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":807},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3253,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2107,"cache_read_input_tokens":928736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3253,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3253},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_019M92k1dpWiBTPCsiiZQMW3":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && cp js/main.js \"$TMPDIR/main.full.js\" && git show HEAD:fun/hedgerow/js/main.js > js/main.js && python3 - <<'PYEOF'\np = 'js/main.js'\ns = open(p).read()\nold = \"\"\"    renderer.setEffects([...(quality.volumetric ? [G.effects.pass] : []), ...(ao ? [ssao] : []), ...(refl ? [ssr] : []), ...(shaft ? [shafts] : []), ...(quality.volumetric ? [volumetric, taa, G.effects.late, distort, dof] : []), ...(quality.bloom ? [bloom] : []), grade]);\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"    // the passes after the first one that swaps render into the scene's own buffer, whose depth\n    // the later ones still read (taa, the late particles, the haze, the focus): nothing in the\n    // chain may clear it, so depth clears are off from its start to its end\n    renderer.setEffects([KEEP_DEPTH, ...(quality.volumetric ? [G.effects.pass] : []), ...(ao ? [ssao] : []), ...(refl ? [ssr] : []), ...(shaft ? [shafts] : []), ...(quality.volumetric ? [volumetric, taa, G.effects.late, distort, dof] : []), ...(quality.bloom ? [bloom] : []), grade, CLEAR_DEPTH]);\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nold = \"\"\"function applyGraphics() {\"\"\"\nnew = \"\"\"// around the effects chain: no depth clears inside it (see applyGraphics), back on for the next frame's scene\nconst KEEP_DEPTH = { enabled: true, needsSwap: false, render(r) { r.autoClearDepth = false; } };\nconst CLEAR_DEPTH = { enabled: true, needsSwap: false, render(r) { r.autoClearDepth = true; } };\n\nfunction applyGraphics() {\"\"\"\nassert old in s; s = s.replace(old, new)\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nPYEOF\nnode --check js/main.js && cd ../.. && git diff --stat && git add fun/hedgerow/js/main.js && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: keep the scene depth through the effects chain (fix)\n\nSince the temporal anti-aliasing went in, the second pass in the chain\nthat swaps buffers is TAA, which writes into the scene's own render target\n- and three clears a target's depth before drawing into it. Every pass\nafter it read a cleared depth: the late particles, flames and rain were\nno longer hidden behind walls (the burning truck's flames showed through\nits cab), the heat haze was not masked, and the focus when aiming found\nnothing to focus on (no depth of field at all). Depth clears are now off\nfrom the start of the chain to its end (two tiny passes around it), so the\nscene depth survives for every pass; all of them draw full-screen, so none\nneeds a clear. Verified by reading the depth back after TAA (the rifle at\n0.83 m, the hands at 0.3-0.5 m, not the far plane) and by aiming: the\ntarget is sharp, the street beyond and the rear sight soft again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && cp \"$TMPDIR/main.full.js\" fun/hedgerow/js/main.js && git status --short","description":"Commit the depth fix alone, then restore the blur work"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_019M92k1dpWiBTPCsiiZQMW3":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"8d3f8caa-870b-4bf3-8fa7-a2cdb9a885d9","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgFb31szL2DfS88Hx9Byc","requestRef":"44a374e9-21af-4bb9-a6a2-ab43c9d96f6a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8b4eb24c-7dc8-4d32-9207-7fb1f8626896","timestamp":"2026-10-21T15:04:51.203Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
