{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"cd1fa7ccff8518c7d44c4b69beb38d2b5900d57c02629f57374b373663b37e23","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017sjT377DcCttdzouZZ7iHb","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/README.md","old_string":"    reprojected) · the late particles of `effects.js` and the rain, drawn\n    after it so they stay crisp · `distort.js` heat haze shimmering in a","new_string":"    reprojected) · `motionblur.js` camera motion blur as the view turns\n    or moves (each pixel smeared along its own motion since the last frame\n    over a 180-degree shutter; the rifle and hands stay sharp; high and\n    medium) · the late particles of `effects.js` and the rain, drawn\n    after it so they stay crisp · `distort.js` heat haze shimmering in a"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DuvrVUi7HwFrWeQbLSbPsr","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git add fun/hedgerow/js/motionblur.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/js/config.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: camera motion blur\n\nAs the view turns or moves, each pixel is smeared along the way it moved\non screen since the last frame (motionblur.js, after the temporal\nanti-aliasing): where it was then comes from the scene depth seen with\nlast frame's camera, as in TAA, over half the frame's time (a 180-degree\nshutter), at most 28 pixels at 768 high, in eight taps. The rifle and the\nhands (nearer than 1.2 m) move with the camera and stay sharp, and no tap\nreads them, so they are not smeared into the street behind them; the rain,\nsparks and flames are drawn after it and stay crisp. Skipped when the view\nbarely moves and on a cut (a jump of the camera, a turn of more than 20\ndegrees in one frame). High and medium (quality.blur).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -3 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Commit the motion blur and check the merge"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
