{"parentUuid":"e0d5c491-9f10-43bf-a6c8-23c8e442dded","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5c0a1d-fdd5-4db0-8cbd-a5c82a0adcb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015Q5Bc7umqYrQP17qUUcxza","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"ce7c36c5-e4a4-4db3-b86e-dddf37e25869","timestamp":"2026-10-21T15:05:40.090Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","oldString":"Observed, not fixed (pre-existing, invisible):","newString":"- e0615fa2 rain runs down the walls (materials.js addWeather `streaks`; excluded for soldiers,\n  kit and weapons by name, and for anything skinned).\n- a0b204b2 FIX — merge together with 2c09b946 (TAA), never TAA alone: TAA is the second swapping\n  pass and writes into the scene target, whose depth three clears before drawing; everything after\n  it (late particles/flames/rain occlusion, the heat haze, and the aiming DOF) read a cleared depth.\n  main.js now wraps the chain in KEEP_DEPTH / CLEAR_DEPTH passes (autoClearDepth off inside it).\n- 2839fe62 camera motion blur (motionblur.js, new; after taa; quality.blur on high/medium).\n\nObserved, not fixed (pre-existing, invisible):","originalFile":"# hedgerow-grass session (graphics rounds)\n\nBranch `hedgerow-grass`, worktree `.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass`.\n\nMerged into hedgerow-poc already (a5c4deff):\n- meadow grass (grass.js), ground relief near the eye (terrain.js parallax)\n- stones and twigs (clutter.js + groundmap.js), grass culled to the view\n- close-up bark and moss on tree trunks (materials.js)\n\nOn hedgerow-grass, not yet in hedgerow-poc (all three merge cleanly onto d65f16e9):\n- 0f66dad5 illumination flares over the front: flares.js (new); small hooks in lights.js\n  (far / noLight lights), volumetric.js (per-light fog factor), sky.js (flare glow),\n  effects.js (launch streak), audio.js (pop), main.js (wiring, castShadows extended for\n  flare shadows, shader warm-up at mission start).\n- 09e7b09c flare light in shafts (shafts.js, new; volumetric.js lays it on) and tree crowns\n  casting under the flare (flares.js castersOf: leaf cards with an alpha-cut depth material).\n- 2c09b946 temporal anti-aliasing (taa.js, new): main.js jitters the projection around\n  renderer.render (taa.jitter()/restore()); the chain is now\n  [particles, ssao, ssr, shafts, volumetric, taa, late (additive particles + rain), dof, bloom, grade].\n  effects.js gets a late pass (useLate), weather.js can draw the rain in it (drawLate).\n  Note for camera/first-person work: anything rendered nearer than 1.2 m is treated as moving\n  with the camera (not reprojected); a camera jump over 2 m resets the history.\n- d57e5389 heat haze over the nearest fires and blast shockwave rings (distort.js, new; after\n  taa and the late pass in the chain; effects.js records shocks). Also leaves anything nearer\n  than 1.2 m (the rifle) untouched.\n\n- 3d5edb83 lightning throws hard shadows (flares.js lightning(): the flare's shadowed light,\n  driven from weather.js flashDir when no flare burns; lights.js hemi/key boosts cut).\n- 218c39a5 fires burn as flame (flames.js, new: shader flame billboards, drawn in the late pass;\n  effects.js setFlameShare thins the sprite flames).\n- df6bc348 the river laps its banks; shallows at the ford (materials.js water shader reads the\n  ground map height through shared.grassMap's alpha).\n\nObserved, not fixed (pre-existing, invisible): adding or removing any swapping pass in the effects\nchain changes ~150 pixels by 3-7 levels along a hairline of slope 0.75 through (256,0) at\n1024x768 - some pass's rounding depends on buffer parity. Neither parity shows a visible seam.\n\nTried and dropped: raindrops beaded on rifles/outfits (unreadable at this resolution and lighting).\n\nTesting tip: a headless Chrome (playwright's chromium_headless_shell) renders on the real GPU\nwithout the browser pane; driven over CDP from a scratch script (needs the sandbox off to start).\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":31,"oldLines":6,"newStart":31,"newLines":14,"lines":[" - df6bc348 the river laps its banks; shallows at the ford (materials.js water shader reads the","   ground map height through shared.grassMap's alpha)."," ","+- e0615fa2 rain runs down the walls (materials.js addWeather `streaks`; excluded for soldiers,","+  kit and weapons by name, and for anything skinned).","+- a0b204b2 FIX — merge together with 2c09b946 (TAA), never TAA alone: TAA is the second swapping","+  pass and writes into the scene target, whose depth three clears before drawing; everything after","+  it (late particles/flames/rain occlusion, the heat haze, and the aiming DOF) read a cleared depth.","+  main.js now wraps the chain in KEEP_DEPTH / CLEAR_DEPTH passes (autoClearDepth off inside it).","+- 2839fe62 camera motion blur (motionblur.js, new; after taa; quality.blur on high/medium).","+"," Observed, not fixed (pre-existing, invisible): adding or removing any swapping pass in the effects"," chain changes ~150 pixels by 3-7 levels along a hairline of slope 0.75 through (256,0) at"," 1024x768 - some pass's rounding depends on buffer parity. Neither parity shows a visible seam."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"d8f49d4d-d407-49b1-9f15-53f23da1b04c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","branch":"hedgerow-grass","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote"