{"parentUuid":"d70ebb0d-350e-4a5b-a686-ffff0822d4d6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFbTmdh5GrKwnrvs5hYX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0187rM3EbfWv9cFZsVAfp9Ss","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/sky.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: searchlights and flak over the front\n\nFar beyond the trees to the north, ahead of the mission, the front is\nawake (sky.js front()): three searchlights sweep the low cloud, each a\npale beam from the horizon - the great-circle arc from its foot to its\ntip, widening away from the light, its foot softened by the haze - ending\nin a wide, flattened smear of light on the cloud base where there is\ncloud; and two flak guns send streams of tracer up into the cloud in\nbursts (about seven seconds in twenty), yellow and red, burning out as\nthey climb. Each round is a short streak along its way up rather than a\ndot: a two-pixel dot moving a couple of pixels a frame would all but\nvanish in the temporal anti-aliasing. All in the sky, so the houses and\ntrees hide them; too cheap to measure.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -2 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Commit the searchlights and flak"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":281,"cache_read_input_tokens":966158,"output_tokens":789,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":281,"ep